    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42409" root="وهج" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهَجٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَهِيجٌ</span></b>  The <i>burning,</i> or <i>heat,</i> of fire.
(S, K.) [See 1.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, The <i>diffusion</i> (in a
neut. sense) <i>of the odour</i> of perfume; and the
<i>hot,</i> or <i>strong, odour,</i> thereof. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also,
the latter, The <i>shining, glistening,</i> or <i>glowing,</i> of
a jewel. (L.)

